<title>USA: Peoples Financial sets initial dividend.</title>
<headline>Peoples Financial sets initial dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MASSILLON, Ohio 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peoples Financial Corp said on Friday that it has set its first dividend of $0.075 a share to shareholders of record on February 4, 1997.</p>
<p>The dividend will be paid on February 18, 1997, the company said.</p>
